  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Bastard Sword\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Bastard_Sword_.png\" title=\"Bastard Sword\"><img alt=\"Bastard Sword\" border=\"0\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Bastard_Sword_.png\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Damage Type:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Slashing\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Wielding:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Two-Handed\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Attack Speed:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Fast\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Client weapon speed:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">110\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Client damage coeff:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">0.91\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><b>Bastard Sword</b> is listed on the <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Two-Handed-fighter\" title=\"Category:Two-Handed-fighter\">Two-Handed-fighter</a> weapon list. Stats on this page come from the old weapon lists.</p>\n<p>This weapon also exists in other materials (Cardboard Bastard Sword, Celestial Bastard Sword, Diamond Bastard Sword, Iron Bastard Sword, Obsidian Bastard Sword, Stone Bastard Sword, Tin Bastard Sword, Titanium Bastard Sword, …).</p>\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
